2 CONT * Daughter of Björn Gädda and N.N.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=+%C3%85ke+Pik&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_1873&tab=post SDHK no: 1873]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1300 without day'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Åke Pik announces that upon his daughter Margareta's entry into Gudhem's monastery, he gave her all his and his late wife Kristina's property in Slätthult; further that he bought from Knut Ebbasson all the property in the brother'
2 CONC s castle that the issuer's wife's brother Björn Gädda owned and left this also to the said daughter. This purchase had gone so far that Björn Gädda senior, on behalf of the issuer, had paid the said Björn with a piece of green clo
2 CONC th from Ghent, 5 cattle and 20 marks of money. [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/1873.pdf '''The issuer seals'''].
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Original:  Or. perg. RA 0101  images Post-medieval copies:  Peringskiöld: E 46 f. 9r (reg.); Örnhielm: IV p. 726, Photocopy:  DK, Additional text On the obverse: Per predia slætaholt; with a newer hand: Åke Pijk.
2 CONT SEAL The seal undamaged, on a strip cut from the letter
2 CONT
