2 NOTE  How can one know for sure Peder Vendelbo's shield of nobility if nothing has been preserved of him other than what the Danish nobility calendar describes?
2 NOTE Morian head" can refer to two things
3 CONT 1) an image of a black human head, often used as a target in historical jousting.
3 CONT In historical jousting, a "Morian head" could be a staged image, often made of cardboard, of a black face that was used as a target.
3 CONT It is important to note that the expressions "Morian head" and "Morian" themselves may be considered outdated and potentially offensive today due to their association with colonial and racist stereotypes.
2 NOTE Usikker, men har funnet denne lille beskrivelsen: 
3 CONT Vendelbo. Et sort morianshoved i hvidt. Op hjelmen en sort hat med rødt bånd. Uradel, Jylland. Peder Vendelbo 1279; Jens Vendelbo 1397, NDA side 310 og DAA 1935 II side 109.
3 CONT
3 CONT En skulle nesten tro de hadde drevet med slavehandel, men det er nok litt for tidlig for det.
2 NOTE Hva forestiller dette? Er det anene til Ku klux Clan, Harry Potter eller Georg W Bush?
