2 CONT * http://knygaard.ca/2/30938.html
2 CONT * https://historipediaofficial.wikia.org/wiki/List_of_Swedish_consorts
2 CONT * https://europeanroyalhistory.wordpress.com/2020/05/15/may-15-1470-death-of-king-carl-viii-of-sweden/
2 CONT * https://historum.com/threads/heirs-of-the-kingdom-of-sweden.171986/page-4
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Harrison, Dick ; Karl Knutsson - A Biography , Historical Media, Lund, 2002, ISBN 91-89442-58-X , LIBRIS ID 8693772
2 CONT * Catharina in Wilhelmina Stålberg , Notes on Swedish Women (1864)
2 CONT * Gillingstam, Hans:  Catherine in Swedish biographical lexicon
