1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This is Severin's son, but his mother is not completely known.  During this time period Kristina was freed, involved in a relationship with Severin, and came to Gotland.  It was stated Severin had a child in 1524, 
2 CONC and Von Mehlin named as a God parent.  This could either be Sidsel or Berndt, likely from Kristina, but not proven  
