1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Dorte (Dortha) Thorlufsdatter Bildt (c. 1515/20 – after 1599)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT A Danish noblewoman whose marriages and estates form the legal foundation for identifying the lineage of '''Vognsen af Stenshede''' and its connection to the Norwegian administrative elite of the 17th century.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Parentage''': Daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Thorluf-Pedersen-Bildt-til-Hassing-Hovgård/6000000014673863327?through=6000000014674125113 '''Thorlof (Thorluf) Bildt'''] of Hassinggaard and [https://www.geni.com/people
2 CONC /Ane-Mouritzdatter-Benderup/6000000014025159974?through=6000000014673863327 '''Anne Mouridsdatter Benderup''']. She was the sister of [https://www.geni.com/people/Henrik-Thorlufsen-Bildt-til-Hassing-Hovgård/6000000014673848946?thr
2 CONC ough=6000000014673863327 '''Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt'''], the owner of the [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 '''Vester Hassing Hovgaard'''] estate.
2 CONT * '''Marriages and Kinship''':
2 CONT '''First Marriage (before 1540)''': To [https://www.geni.com/people/Lauritz-Vognsen/6000000007255394401?through=6000000014674125113 '''Lasse (Laurits) Godskesen Vognsen''']. From this marriage, she had a son, [https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /people/Jørgen-Stenshede/6000000003421924369?through=6000000007255394401 '''Jørgen Lauridsen (Lawman in Tønsberg)''']. This union is confirmed by the inheritance of the '''Hovgaard''' estate by her grandson, [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Lars-Jorgensen-Vognsen-Stenshede-of-Hassinggaard/6000000010531322554?through=6000000003421924369 '''Laurids Jørgensen'''], in 1613.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Second Marriage (before 1552)''': To [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Wunckesen/6000000014025374236?through=6000000014674125113 '''Knud Vunkesen (Leve)''']. This marriage produced a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Knuds
2 CONC øn-til-Mosbjerggaard/6000000014764077548?through=6000000014025374236 '''Knud Knudsen Vunkesen'''], who in 1629 was legally identified as the "uncle" (uterine half-brother of the father) to her grandson, '''Laurids Jørgensen''', so
2 CONC lidifying the kinship between the Vognsen and Vunkesen families.
2 CONT * '''Estate and Status (Hovgaard)''': Dorte was a woman of significant standing and property. According to the 1599 Church Reports ([https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf '''Præsteindberetninger''']) for Vendelbo Stift, she resid
2 CONC ed at her own estate in [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 '''Vester Hassing''']: "...Herforuden findis v. '''Hendrick Bildes''' gardt och v. frue '''Dorithi Bildes''', som di selffuer paaboer"
2 CONC  (Besides this, there are the farms of Sir Henrik Bildt and Lady Dorithi Bildt, where they themselves reside). This record confirms she was still alive and managing her property in 1599.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Præsteindberetninger''' om fæstegods m.v. i Vendelbo Stift 1568 og 1599, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf p. 187].
2 CONT # '''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''' (DAÅ) 1887, [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1887/0117.html p. 77].
2 CONT # '''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''' (DAÅ) 1906, [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1906/0576.html p. 504].
2 CONT # '''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''' (DAÅ) 1936:2, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf pp. 94, 97].
2 CONT # '''Norske Rigsregistranter 1628-1634''', ed. O. G. Lundh, [https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false p. 186].
2 CONT # '''Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift''' 1989:2 (Dion S. E. Maaneskjold), [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf p. 136].
2 CONT # '''Kr. Værnfelt i JySaml'''. 5. Rk. III. 1937–38, [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.pdf p. 178].
2 CONT #  '''Trap Danmark'''. 5th Edition. Edited by N. Nielsen, P. Skautrup, and Povl Engelstoft. Vol. VI, 2: "Ålborg Amt". Article by C. Rise Hansen. ([https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 History of V
2 CONC ester Hassing Hovgård and the 1613/1620 inheritance divisions]).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''PR Æ S T E IN D B E R E T N IN G E R OM FÆ STEG O D S M. V. I VENDELBO STIFT 1568 og 1599. '''Dorte Thorlufsdatter, til Hassing Hovgård, S. 187:''''' VESTER OG ØSTER HASSING SOGNE. Register offuer huis décimantes, som findis vdi
2 CONC  '''Hassinge''' sogner: "...Herforuden findis v. '''Hendrick Bildes''' gardt och v. '''frue Dorithi Bildes''', som di selffuer paaboer." [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf Link]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I34533&tree=2 '''Finnholbek.dk''']
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Dorthe Thorlufsdatter Bildt'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född:	cirka 1520 
2 CONT * Död:	
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dotter till Thorluf Pedersen Bildt, til Hovgaard och Ane Mouritzdatter (Benderup) 
2 CONT * Hustru till Knud Wunckesen; Jens Vognsen och Lasse Godskesen 
2 CONT * Moder till Christine Knudsdatter Leve; Knud Knudsen, ,til Mosbjerggaard, och Torlof Knudsen 
2 CONT * Syster till Knud Thorlufsen Bildt; Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt och Johanne Thorlufsdatter Bildt 
2 CONT ----
