2 CONC n Vedbo HD in Småland. Owned Earth in Färentuna HD and Danderyds SKPLG in Uppland. Was 1.9 1373 married to the Privy Council Finvid Finvidsson (Frössviksätten), which appeared in the sources 1351 — 1378 and was previously married 
2 CONC to a daughter of Gustav Arvidsson (Sparre of Vik).
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Magnus ' daughter'''. Was dead 6.12 1389. Inherited Tranås in Säby sn in Norra Vedbo HD in Småland and moved to Earth in the same HD. was married to Magnus Karlsson (örnfot), which occurs 1355 — 1362.
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Magnus ' daughter'''. Lived yet 28.8 1398 but begrossed 7.9 s. Å in Vadstena monastery. Inherited Edshult in Likanämnd sn in southern Vedbo HD in Småland. Was first married to Mils VII (stump), who died before 1369. 
