2 CONT Lars in Forsby (V. Ed's son) sells to, '''Bo Jonsson, drots''' in Sweden 3 acres of land in Flugenäs in Dalhem's parish in [N.] Tjust's district for 12 öre Swedish money. This was done in county council in Västervik. 12 fasts are 
2 CONC enumerated. On the back, signature of Margareta Grip: "her Boo".
2 CONT
