2 CONT
2 CONT Contents "Itt Lindorm Biörsons (Vinge) lagmandz papers breff, that he sentenced Näs and Esswiken to Ramund Bassa wife, and to Lars Hughesson celebrate copper again, which ter against skencht war, Mcdlxxxviij."
2 CONT
2 CONT Headline: "... besieged on Dal."
