2 CONT
2 CONT SDHK-nr: 36770
2 CONT
2 CONT Issued: 15100714, Sjögerås Content: Lindorm Björnsson's children Lars, Hans, Mattis Kafle, Birgitta, Kristina and Anna change the inheritance of his sister with his son in (first or second marriage) Knut Lindormsson.
2 CONT
