2 CONT Died: 1499 (59-68) Borgholm, Öland, Sweden
2 CONT Profession: Judge in Västergötland, Kanik
2 CONT From 1476 he was district judge in Vilske härad and privy councillor in 1478. Lindorm was also a lawman in Västergötland 1481-1498 and courtier at Öresten castle 1486-1488.
2 CONT Son of Björn Nilsson (Vinge) and Kristina Abjörnsdotter (Bagge af Berga)
2 CONT Husband of.
2 CONT Cecilia Simonsdotter Båt marriage 1463 in Lödöse
2 CONT Birgitta Mårtensdotter Svan, marriage in 1467
2 CONT Christina Laurensdotter
2 CONT Father of Knut Lindormsson (Vinge), of Sjögerås; Ana Sparre; Laurens Lindormsson Vinge; Hans Lindormsson Vinge; Birgitta Lindormsdotter Vinge; Kristina Lindormsdotter Vinge and Märta Lindormsdotter Vinge
2 CONT Brother of Abjörn Björnsson (Vinge); Olof Björnsson (Vinge) and Nils Björnsson (Vinge)
2 CONT Half-brother of Ingeborg Bjørnsdotter Vinge
