2 CONT =Arvid Arvidsson Drake af Intorp, (No.82)=       
2 CONT * Son of Arvid Jönsson Drake af Intorp, (No.82) and Ingegärd Petersdotter Prika 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Arvid+Drake+&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=33&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C&postid=sdhk_38941&tab=post#tab '''38941''']
