2 CONT '''Gotskalk Limbek'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Knight:	Ridder, Riddare 
2 CONT * Born:	1258 Lembek, Flensborg, Germany 
2 CONT * Dead:	before circa 1335 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Henrik Limbek and NN 
2 CONT * Husband of N.N. Nielsdatter Gyldenstierne 
2 CONT * Father of Lyder Limbek; Timme Gotchalksen Limbek; Claus Gotskalksen Limbek; Gotskalk Gotskalksen Limbek; Johannes Lydersen Limbek; Markvard Gotskalksen Limbek; Emmeke Gotskalksen Limbek, til Morkjær; Otte Limbek Rameskop and Lyd
2 CONC er Limbeck 
2 CONT * Brother of Ellen Henriksdatter Limbeck; Otte Limbek and Markvard Limbek 
2 CONT ----
