2 CONT * Son of Trotte Petersson (Eka) and Ingegerd Bjälboättens oäkta gren 
2 CONT * Occurrence at the earliest 1364. Was the Chief of Chief in Åkerbo hd in Västmanland 1388. Became a knight between 1388 and 1391, possibly 1389-02-24 just before the battle of Falköping. Belongs to the Council of 1398. Owned land
2 CONC  in Siende, Tuhundra and Åkerbo hd and the city of Västerås in Västmanland. Weapon: Twice cut shield. 
2 CONT * Mentioned 1333–1362. Knights , governor of Tveta in Småland 1353, national council 1357. He wrote to Benhammar .
2 CONT
