2 CONT * Ang. Kärling, see K. Janzon in the Family Research Journal 2006, pp. 257-268.
2 CONT * Swedish reference book , Malmö 1931
2 CONT * Medieval regest / note:  Notes in Genealogica 41, fol. 8v, 9 and 15v; Genealogica 26: II, fol. 69, RA
2 CONT * Post-medieval transcriptions:  Hadorph: J. Hadorph's “Big Copie Book” E 73, pag. 114 [= A], VHAA: Dep., RA; Örnhielm: Örnhielms diplomatarium XII, no 106 [= B], VHAA's dep., RA
2 CONT * Post-medieval regest / note:  Rasmus Ludvigsson's list of S. Clarae monastery's land letters, sign. 109: ??, RA (VHAA's dep) 0401; the same list of Gustaf Vasa's donation letter, Uppland no. 74, Sprinkled room. Acts, Vol. 1, G 4
2 CONC  and 2, RA
2 CONT * About Ingegerd Jonsdotter (Folkungaättens illegitimate branch), who was first married to Trotte Petersson (Ekaätten; died no later than 1364), and most recently married to Henrik Reventlow in 1371, see DS X, no. 288 with comment
2 CONC  and ÄSF I, p. 47. About the sons Magnus and Johan Trottesson and the gulls Lars Björnsson, Tideke Pinnow and Kort Görtz, see ÄSF I, p. 224. For this part of Ekaätten, see also E. Nordström in PHT 1941-1942, p. 17 ff. About Lars B
2 CONC jörnsson see also SRM p. 57.
2 CONT * Compare letter 1370 9/8 (DS no. 8168) in which Ingegerd with the consent of his son Magnus Trottesson donates a land land in Ekhammar in the parish of Näs as donation for sister Elin to St. Klara monastery.
2 CONT * The transcript of the letter text has obvious formal flaws. Among other things, the pronoun "warä" ("spring") (r. 3) should only refer to Ingegerd. Another example is the subsequent phrase about the husband's consent ("medh mys 
2 CONC husboändä gotwiljä ok kärärelse", not included in the regiment) which is superfluous since he is one of the letter's issuer.
2 CONT * Alla vägar bär till Rom: 75 generationer från von Wachenfeldt och Uggla till, By Bjarne Persson - https://books.google.com/books?id=IqoyDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA94&lpg=PA94&dq=Magnus+Trottesson+(Eka)&source=bl&ots=FDcMnBHMCK&sig=ACfU3U1fuy
2 CONC sR5RlfNbbiBt8I-7Q-wRcFGg&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjMrKKZ16XqAhURgp4KHResCck4ChDoATAEegQIBBAB#v=onepage&q=Magnus%20Trottesson%20(Eka)&f=false
2 CONT * Svenska autograf sällskapets tidskrift - https://books.google.com/books?id=VnFBAAAAYAAJ&pg=RA1-PA35&lpg=RA1-PA35&dq=Magnus+Trottesson+(Eka)&source=bl&ots=jGlFSKaFAR&sig=ACfU3U3SNPYqP_TFnRghnrTsYVWVvyKhsQ&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjM
2 CONC rKKZ16XqAhURgp4KHResCck4ChDoATAFegQIARAB#v=onepage&q=Magnus%20Trottesson%20(Eka)&f=false
2 CONT * 
