1 NOTE Herr Thomes Iversen Lange  was born about 1340 in Tjæreborg, Ribe. He died after 1392 in Ribe, Denmark. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1371 he bought property in Skads Herred from Bothilda, the wife of Esge Eskildsen. He was present 
2 CONT in 1377 at Varde Syssel Assembly. In 1378 at Ribed Cathedral he was "voldgiftsmann" in an argument 
2 CONT between a Canon and Henneke Limbek. He was named as a witness in Ribe Cathedral in 1392
