1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Sophie Ottesdatter Brahe==
2 CONT
2 CONT http://brainprick.com/sophie-brahe-a-renowned-danish-astronomer-genealogist-and-chemist-of-16th-and-17th-century/
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I10102&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT Sophie Ottesdatter Brahe was an astronomer, astrologer, alchemist and author of a genealogical history of her family. 
2 CONT
