1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Metta (ej Märta) Olofsdotter. Dog tidigast 1485. Var gift med lagmannen Erik Bidz, som nämnes 1460—1464 och uppges ha bott på Viik i Kimito sn. Omgift med lagmannen Jeppe Persson, som torde ha dött mellan 1485 och 
2 CONC 1487. https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tavast#TAB_3
2 CONT
2 CONT Date 29.5,1469 Rome
2 CONT
2 CONT The layman Jeppe Pedersson and Metta, the daughter of Olof Tavast, from the diocese of Turku, married despite knowing that they are related in the fourth degree of consanguinity and the fourth degree of affinity; the marriage was 
2 CONC consummated. For this reason, they request absolution from excommunication and dispensation, so that they may remain in and renew the marriage and have their offspring considered legimate. The petition is granted by the regent Joh
2 CONC annes, bishop of Savona, and settled the datary.
