2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/K%C3%B6kem%C3%A4ster
2 CONT
2 CONT While Hans Klasson is widely presumed to be the father of Katharina Hansdotter, there is currently no definitive reference or conclusive evidence to substantiate this claim.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Hansdotter, Hustru Karin till Växiö (Kangasala) vanh.;
2 CONT
