2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Cecilia Haraldsdotter Gren,''' birth: before 1427 & died: after 1464, married Eskil Isaksson (Banér).  Cecilia Haraldsdotter (Gren), year of birth and death unknown (still living in 1465), was a Swedish noblewoman. She was th
2 CONC e daughter of Harald Stensson Gren and Sigrid Tomasdotter van Vitzen and the niece of Councilor Magnus Gren . She also became the grandmother of Gustav Vasa 's mother .
2 CONT * '''Tomas Haraldsson (Gren),''' died: before 1458
