2 CONT
2 CONT * The genus von Vitzen is the Swedish branch of the Mecklenburg family of Witzen.
2 CONT * The genus is also known in Denmark with Arnold von Witzen 1336 and last with the armed Fikke von Witzen 1425.  In Sweden, the genus first appeared with the aforementioned Thomas van Vitzen.
2 CONT * Daughter of Thomas van Vitzen and Märta Finvidsdotter Stallere 
