1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jep Mogensen Seefeld, til Refsnæs'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Han er eierRefsnæs i Hellum Herred  fra 1400 til  1434''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Jep (Jacob) sønn av Mogens Seefeld, moren er ukjent 
2 CONT * Han er gift med Margrethe Jensdatter Løvenbalk, de hadde sønnen Morten og sannsynligvis  datteren Ingjerd
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1400 Jep elller Jakob); til Refnæs (Hellum Herred.), nevnes sammen med sin bror Thomes
2 CONT * 1406  Begge nevnes igjen
2 CONT * 1500 En landtingsdom nevner skifte mellom disse to brødrene.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kilder:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen. Danmarks Adels Aarbog. Dansk Adelsforening, DAA 1914:455.
2 CONT # https://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I24635&tree=2
2 CONT # http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/Seefeld/Sefeld.htm
2 CONT #http://www.danskeherregaarde.dk/nutid/refsnaes
2 CONT # https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Refsn%C3%A6s_(hovedg%C3%A5rd)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Jep el. Jakob); til Refnæs (Hellum H.), nævnes 1400 sammen med sin Broder Thomes, og atter ligesom denne 1406, ligesom en Landsthingsdom af 1500 nævner et Skifte mellem disse Brødre 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.onlineslaegtsforskning.dk/historie/historiskeaner.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Jep Mogensen til Refsnaes, known 1400-1406, married Margrethe Jensdatter Løvenbalk.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Jep Mogensen til Refsnaes, known 1400-1406, married Margrethe Jensdatter L?venbalk.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1. Morten Jepsen til Refsnaes, known from 1434, died 1477, married 1stly Kirsten Mogensdatter Galt (died aefore 1424); married 2ndly N. N. Nielsdatter Krabbe (died before 1434); married 1437 Birgitte Poulsdatter Hvide (died afte
2 CONC r 1491).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.1. Oluf Mortensen til Refsnaes, died before 1477, married Bente Lauridsdatter Vestenie.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.2. J?rgen Mortensen til Refsnaes, died before 1468 unmarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3. Jens Mortensen til Refsnaes, known 1476, died before 1499, married Birgitte Nielsdatter Banner.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.1. Anders Jensen, known 1499.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2. Niels Jensen til Refsnaes, died about 1537, married Anne Lauridsdatter Viffert.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.1. Jens Nielsen, known 1536-42.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2. Laurids Nielsen til Refsnaes, died 1552, married Anne Ottesdatter Munk (died after 1566).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.1. Oluf Lauridsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.2. Otte Lauridsen Seefeld, died during the seven years war.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.3. Viffert Lauridsen, died in battle 20 October 1565 at Svarteraa.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.4. Enevold Lauridsen, killed whilst sleeping in his chair at Riberhus.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5. Christoffer Lauridsen til Refsnaes, born 4 November 1543, died 2 March 1612, buried 16 March 1612, married 14 February 1580 Else Nielsdatter Benderup til Kvottrup (died about 1642, buried N?rre Kongerslev church).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.1. Laurids Seefeld, born about 1581, died after 1612.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.2. Mourids Seefeld, died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.3. Christen Seefeld, died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.4. Enevold Seefeld, died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.5. Viffert Seefeld til Refsnaes, Viffertsholm and Tustrup, born 31 October 1588 at Refsnaes, died 24 October 1662 at Viffertsholm.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.6. Enevold Seefeld til Kjellerup, died 1643, married Anne J?rgensdatter Urne (died 1651).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.7. J?rgen Seefeld til Refsnaes, born 7 March 1594 at Refsnaes, died 28 February 1662 at Copenhagen.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.8. Anne, died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.9. Anne, died before 12 February 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.10. Marine til Refsnaes and Viffertsholm, died 1678, aged almost 100!
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.6. Kirsten, married Jens Munk til Havbro.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.7. Anne til Asfaerg, alive 1580, married Anders Munk.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.8. Else til Komdrup, alive 1580.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.3. N. N., married Niels Brun til Kongstedlund.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.3. Ellen, died after 1509, married Mads Jensen Viffert til Kongstedlund.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.4. Ide, died after 1519, married Thomes Pedersen lf i Vesterbaek, died after 1499.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.4. Sophie til Refsnaes, died after 1497, married after 1477 Knud Thomesen Vognsen af H?rbylund (died before 1485).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.5. Ellen, died after 1472 a nun at ?rslev Abbey.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.6. N. N., married Las Bratze Saltensee af Linde (died after 1496).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.7. Anne, died after 1486 at Mariager Abbey.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.8. Inger, died after 1464, married Niels Pedersen Skovgaard til Egenbjerg.
