1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Lauritz (Lasse) Godskesen Vognsen af Stenshede (before 1515 - after 1571)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Key Biographical Details:'''
2 CONT •	In 1566, he was in the naval service ("1566 til søs").
2 CONT •	In 1568, he was released from military service ("1568 fritaget for krigstjeneste").
2 CONT •	By 1571, he had squandered his estate ("havde 1571 forødt sit gods"), in connection with which Otto Banner was appointed guardian to Lady [https://www.geni.com/people/Bodil-Vognsdatter-af-Hæstrup/6000000004846585584?through=6000
2 CONC 000004846400263 Bodil], the wife of his brother ([https://www.geni.com/people/Vogn-Vognsen-af-Stenshede/6000000004846400263 Vogn (Godskesen) Vognsen til Stenshede]).
2 CONT •	''Source: [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf Danmarks Adels Aarbog (DAÅ) 1936:2], pp. 97, 108.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriages and Progeny:'''
2 CONT '''First wife''' - [https://www.geni.com/people/Dorthe-Thorlufsdatter-Bildt-of-Hassing-Hovgaard/6000000014674125113?through=6000000015948596620 Dortha (Dorte) Thorlufsdatter Bildt], daughter of Thorlof Bildt of Hassinggaard and An
2 CONC ne Mouridsdatter Benderup.
2 CONT •	In her second marriage, Dorte was married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Wunckesen/6000000014025374236?through=6000000014674125113 Knud Vunkesen (Knudsen) Leve].
2 CONT •	''Sources: [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf DAÅ 1936:2], p. 97; [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1887/0117.html DAÅ 1887], p. 77; [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1906/0576.html DAÅ 1906], p. 504.''
2 CONT '''Second wife (presumably)''' - N Vognsdatter Benderup, sister of [https://www.geni.com/people/Poul-Vognsen-Benderup-til-Støttrup/6000000046240668922 Poul Benderup].
2 CONT •	The genealogy in [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf DAÅ 1936:2], p. 105 indicates that Laurids Vognsen was married to the "sister" of Povl Vognsen (Benderup) til Støttrup, but this is not confirmed in the genealogical liter
2 CONC ature regarding the family line.
2 CONT •	Possibly identical to [https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Vognsdatter-Benderup/6000000046240533918?through=6000000046240668922 Anne Vognsdatter Benderup].
2 CONT ''•	Sources:
2 CONT o	[https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift. Samfundet for dansk genealogi og Personalhistorie. Årgang 109 1989:2] (diagram, p. 126).
2 CONT o	[https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf DAÅ 1936:2], p. 105.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hypothesis Regarding the Identity of Laurids Vognsen and Lasse Godskesen Vognsen:'''
2 CONT According to the research by Dion S. E. Maaneskjold (''[https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift, 1989:2, p. 136]''), Laurids Vognsen is likely the same person as Lasse Godskesen Vognsen, the husband of 
2 CONC Dorte Bildt (daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Thorluf-Pedersen-Bildt-til-Hassing-Hovgård/6000000014673863327?through=6000000014674125113 Torlof Bildt] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Ane-Mouritzdatter-Benderup/60000000140
2 CONC 25159974?through=6000000014673863327 Anne Mouridsdatter Benderup]).
2 CONT ''*Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift'' is the leading Danish journal for genealogy, published by'' Samfundet for dansk genealogi og Personalhistorie'' (The Society for Danish Genealogy and Personal History).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Evidence of Identity:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1. Document Pertaining to Inheritance (1629):'''
2 CONT •	[https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Knudsøn-til-Mosbjerggaard/6000000014764077548?through=6000000014674125113 Knud Knudsen Vunkesen (Leve)] claimed rights to the inheritance of his "nephew" (brother's son) - [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Lars-Jorgensen-Vognsen-Stenshede-of-Hassinggaard/6000000010531322554?through=6000000003421924369 Laurids Jørgensen (Vognsen af Stenshede) til Strøm].
2 CONT •	Laurids Jørgensen is the grandson of Laurids Vognsen and Dorte Bildt.
2 CONT •	Common ancestor: Dorte Torlufsdatter Bildt, who was:
2 CONT o	married in her first marriage to Lasse Godskesen Vognsen;
2 CONT o	married in her second marriage to Knud Wunkesen (Knud Vunkesen Leve), the father of Knud Knudsen.
2 CONT •	The son of Lasse Godskesen Vognsen and Dorte Bildt was [https://www.geni.com/people/Jørgen-Stenshede/6000000003421924369?through=6000000010531322554 Jørgen], the father of Laurids Jørgensen. This relationship makes Jørgen Laurid
2 CONC sen and Knud Knudsen uterine half-brothers (sharing the same mother, Dorte Bildt), which explains the legal basis for the inheritance claim.
2 CONT •	''Source: [https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false Norske rigs-registranter tildeels i uddrag: bd. 1628-1634, ed. O. G. Lundh], p. 186; [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf DAÅ 1936:2]
2 CONC , p. 106.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2. Chronology of Dorte Bildt’s Marriages:'''
2 CONT •	First marriage (before ~1540): to Lasse Godskesen Vognsen, birth of Jørgen.
2 CONT •	Dissolution of the marriage (~1540s): not due to death, but through divorce or '''annulment''' (possibly due to their status as third cousins under canon law).
2 CONT •	Second marriage (before ~1552): to [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Wunckesen/6000000014025374236?through=6000000014764077548 Knud Vunkesen], birth of [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Knudsøn-til-Mosbjerggaard/6000000014764077
2 CONC 548?through=6000000014025374236 Knud Knudsen].
2 CONT •	Death of Knud (Sr.) in 1570; Lasse (already divorced) died after 1571.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''3. Financial Problems of Lasse Godskesen:'''
2 CONT •	By 1571, he had "squandered his estate" ("havde 1571 forødt sit gods").
2 CONT •	This could previously have been the reason for the dissolution of the marriage, to protect Dorte and her children from ruin and loss of status. Thus, the possible reason for the divorce was a combination of Lasse's financial pro
2 CONC blems and pressure from the Bildt family, who wanted to protect their daughter (Dorte) and her inheritance. Although divorce was rare in those days, it was possible if there were serious grounds and the consent of both influential
2 CONC  families. It should be noted''' that Lasse and Dorte's third cousinship''' was sufficient grounds to initiate the process of annulment of their marriage, especially if they or their families desired the divorce for financial or p
2 CONC ersonal reasons.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''4. Inheritance of [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 Vester Hassing Hovgård (1613)]:'''
2 CONT •	After the death of [https://www.geni.com/people/Henrik-Thorlufsen-Bildt-til-Hassing-Hovgård/6000000014673848946?through=6000000014674125113 Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt] (1613), the estate [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-so
2 CONC gn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 Vester Hassing Hovgård] passed to Laurids Jørgensen Vognsen (grandson of Lasse Godskesen and Dorte Bildt).
2 CONT •	This confirms the inheritance rights of Laurids Jørgensen through his grandmother Dorte Bildt, which proves her marriage to Lasse Godskesen.
2 CONT ''•	Source: [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.pdf Kr. Værnfelt i JySaml. 5. Rk. III. 1937-38], p. 178.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5. Inheritance of the Vester Hassing Hovgård Estate (1613):'''
2 CONT •	According to the clerical tithe reports ([https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf Præsterberetninger om fæstegods i Vendelbo Stift 1568-1599]), Dorte Torlufsdatter Bildt owned a part of the Vester Hassing Hovgård estate '''where 
2 CONC she was still residing in 1599'''. After the death of her brother Henrik Bildt in 1613, his holdings were divided among the heirs.
2 CONT •	Laurids Jørgensen (Dorte's grandson) received a share in the estate, which confirms:
2 CONT o	the succession of ancestral holdings within the Bildt family;
2 CONT o	the preservation of the property rights of Dorte's descendants through the Vognsen line.
2 CONT •	''Source: [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf PRÆSTEINDBERETNINGER OM FÆSTEGODS M. V. I VENDELBO STIFT 1568 og 1599].'' Clerical tithe registers of the Vendelbo Diocese (Rigsarkivet), as well as later documents regarding the
2 CONC  division of the inheritance in 1613.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Final Conclusion:'''
2 CONT All the facts - from the 1629 inheritance lawsuit to land records and evidence of extravagance - form a consistent picture, confirming that Laurids Vognsen and Lasse Godskesen Vognsen are one and the same person. Their connection 
2 CONC to the Bildt and Vunkesen families was through Dorte Torlufsdatter Bildt.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''List of Sources and References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1. Genealogical Yearbooks (Danmarks Adels Aarbog)''':
2 CONT * '''DAÅ 1887''': ''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''. Copenhagen: Vilhelm Tryde, 1887, [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1887/0117.html p. 77].
2 CONT * '''DAÅ 1906''': ''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''. Copenhagen: Vilhelm Tryde, 1906, [https://runeberg.org/adelaarbog/1906/0576.html p. 504].
2 CONT * '''DAÅ 1936''': ''Danmarks Adels Aarbog''. Section 2: Genealogy of the Vognsen of Stenshede Family. Copenhagen, 1936, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf pp. 94, 97, 105, 106, 108].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2. Periodicals and Research Papers''':
2 CONT * '''Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift 1989:2''': Maaneskjold, Dion S. E. ''The Vognsen Family of Stenshede''. Published by the Society for Danish Genealogy and Personal History, Vol. 109, 1989. P. 126 (diagram), [https://slaegtsbiblio
2 CONC tek.dk/900550.pdf p. 136] (identification hypothesis).
2 CONT * '''Jyske Samlinger 1937-38''': Værnfelt, Kr. ''Hassing Hovgård''. Journal of Jutlandic History, Language, and Literature. 5th Series, Vol. III, 1937-38, [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.p
2 CONC df p. 178].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''3. Archival Records and Primary Documents''':
2 CONT * '''Norske Rigs-Registranter (1628-1634)''': ''Norwegian State Registers (Excerpts), Vol. 6: 1628-1634''. Ed. by O. G. Lundh. Christiania (Oslo), 1880, [https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=f
2 CONC alse p. 186] (Legal claim of 1629 regarding the inheritance of Laurids Jørgensen).
2 CONT * '''Clerical Reports (Vendelbo Diocese)''': '''Præsteindberetninger''' om fæstegods i Vendelbo Stift [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/907817.pdf 1568-1599]. Reports on copyhold farms and estate holdings of the Bildt family at Vester 
2 CONC Hassing Hovgård.
2 CONT
