2 CONC cript of Rasmus Ludvigsson's large lost genealogy of Anna Pedersdtr Bielke's genealogy), b 195, 195 v, 246, 292, 421, RA; Västergötl's deal 1604: 4 B: 3, 1605: 10 A: 2, salvation and rust service, RKB, Sandbergska col Y 3824—3825,
2 CONC  actuarial account's oblation I: 58: 6, red: check archive FI : 52, Sv donation account archive FI a: 185, KA; Hope hearing 1592—93, SIA; F 1 5: 6 (Peringskiöld, Churches in Södermani 1686), f 49v, Rålamb, Fol, vol 12 (copy of Ras
2 CONC mus Ludvigsson's large lost genealogy of Anna Pedersdtr Bielke's genealogy), b 194, 194v, 245, 291, 391, KB; Anna Pedersdtr Bielke's familyb, f 54, JO Åkerstein's genealogies of introductory families, KH Karlsson's Biogr notes to 
2 CONC the Middle Ages, Biografica, personal register to GIR, alphabetical note register to letter recipients in HKR and to the titular register to RR 1561-1616, excerpts from Västergötl's dumbbells and briefly mentioned therein. , genea
2 CONC logy, coat of arms and farmhouse reg to Rålamb, Fol vol 12, o Skokloster I, fol 57, RHA; perg: letter 1 March 1495, X 58 (C Annerstedt, Sv medieval saviors), UUB; Arboga Thought Book 1569—1613, City Hall, Arboga; perg.brev 1519 o 
