2 _MARNM Gyllenhaal
1 NAME Nils Gunnesson Gyllenhaal
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1600
2 PLAC Härene (P)
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE OCT 1680
2 PLAC Härene
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Adlad löjtnant, Löjtnant vid Västgöta Kavalleriregemente
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Gyllenhaal_nr_814
2 CONT
2 CONT A man called Gunne Olofsson Haal of Härene parish, died about 1634 had issue a son, Nils Gunnesson Haal, born Kulling county district, raised to the peerage of Sweden with the surname Gyllenhaal, died about 1680 or 1681, buried Hä
2 CONC rene cemetery, married Märta Hierta (died 1697) and had issue as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Catharina, born 1632, died 4 January 1735 at Vinstorp, aged 103, married 1stly Hans Thorstensson Hillesköld (died 1653); married 2ndly Johan Trast (born 1652, died 10 January 1707 at Åsen, buried 3 February 1707 at Essunga chur
2 CONC ch).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Gudmund Gyllenhaal, born 1643, died 1 March 1701, married Beata Rosendufva (died 17 March 1725).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1. Carl Gyllenhaal, born 1680, died 8 February 1800.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2. Anna Christina, born 25 March 1685, died 10 August 1739, married 2 December 1722 Johan Botvid Gyllensting (born 1697, died 1752).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.3. Metta, born 1691, died unmarried 5 March 1711.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.4. Ludvig Gyllenhaal, died young.
2 CONT
