2 CONC hUKEwi68qiYvJrfAhWBwMQHHThwB104ChDoATACegQIARAB#v=onepage&q=Jakob%20Björnsson%20(Bååt)&f=false
2 CONT * Abrahamsson - Granfelt, Volume 1 - https://books.google.com/books?id=ZgwbOEtYuWcC&pg=PA367&lpg=PA367&dq=Jakob+Björnsson+(Bååt)&source=bl&ots=VbDKErjMBU&sig=vEgXIakJcvX2zlBSjtnA6QXl6u0&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwik14nvvJrfAhUIxFQKHQar
