1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Somebody previously claimed this man was born in "Kristianstad, Sweden" in 1588. That is incorrect. Kristianstad/Christianstad was founded in 1614 by King Christian IV of Denmark. The city became Swedish in 1658, w
2 CONC hen Palle was already dead. He was Danish.
