2 CONC arre [af Skåne]. Kilde: DAA 1917: Sparre [af Skåne] s 519.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.dk/books?id=ZoPqntyJE3cC&pg=PA88&lpg=PA88&dq=jep+jepsen+ravensberg&source=bl&ots=yYIxMw2jXO&sig=III7m3DnEPO0krU6WIEt711wBkk&hl=da&sa=X&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=jep%20jepsen%20ravensberg&f=false
